{"seq":4,"slug":"memory-and-tuning","title":"内存与调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/performance/memory-and-tuning","wordCount":963,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"内存与调优\">内存与调优</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SQLite 的性能很大程度上取决于内存使用方式：<strong>页面缓存</strong>（Page Cache）在内存中保留最近访问的页面以减少磁盘 I/O，<strong>内存映射 I/O</strong> 通过 mmap 绕开系统调用开销，<strong>临时存储</strong>则决定排序和中间结果落在内存还是磁盘。围绕这些机制配置相关 PRAGMA，并配合 VACUUM 与 ANALYZE，就构成了 SQLite 调优的主体。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"页面缓存\">页面缓存</h2><p>SQLite 通过<strong>页面缓存</strong>（Page Cache）在内存中维护最近访问过的数据库页面，减少磁盘 I/O。缓存命中率直接影响查询性能。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    QUERY[查询请求] --&gt; CACHE{页面在&lt;br/&gt;缓存中?}&#10;    CACHE --&gt;|命中| MEM[从内存读取]&#10;    CACHE --&gt;|未命中| DISK[从磁盘读取]&#10;    DISK --&gt; LOAD[加载到缓存]&#10;    LOAD --&gt; MEM\">graph LR\n    QUERY[查询请求] --&gt; CACHE{页面在&lt;br/&gt;缓存中?}\n    CACHE --&gt;|命中| MEM[从内存读取]\n    CACHE --&gt;|未命中| DISK[从磁盘读取]\n    DISK --&gt; LOAD[加载到缓存]\n    LOAD --&gt; MEM</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 设置页面缓存大小&#10;-- 正数：页面数；负数：以 KB 为单位&#10;PRAGMA cache_size = -64000;&#10;&#10;-- 查看当前缓存大小&#10;PRAGMA cache_size;&#10;&#10;-- 查看实际缓存使用情况&#10;PRAGMA cache_spill;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 设置页面缓存大小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 正数：页面数；负数：以 KB 为单位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA cache_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看当前缓存大小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA cache_size;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看实际缓存使用情况</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA cache_spill;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>推荐值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>cache_size</td>\n<td>-2000</td>\n<td>-64000</td>\n<td>页面缓存大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cache_spill</td>\n<td>启用</td>\n<td>启用</td>\n<td>缓存溢出时写回磁盘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>page_size</td>\n<td>4096</td>\n<td>4096</td>\n<td>页面大小（创建时设置）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 页面大小影响缓存效率&#10;-- 创建数据库前设置（创建后不可更改，除非 VACUUM）&#10;PRAGMA page_size = 8192;&#10;&#10;-- 通过 VACUUM 更改已有数据库的页面大小&#10;PRAGMA page_size = 8192;&#10;VACUUM;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 页面大小影响缓存效率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 创建数据库前设置（创建后不可更改，除非 VACUUM）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA page_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8192</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 通过 VACUUM 更改已有数据库的页面大小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA page_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8192</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">VACUUM;</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 对于包含大量 BLOB 数据或大行的数据库，增大页面大小可以减少溢出页的使用，提升读取效率。对于以小型行为主的数据库，4096 字节是最佳选择。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"内存映射-i-o\">内存映射 I/O</h2><p><strong>mmap</strong>（内存映射 I/O）允许 SQLite 将数据库文件的一部分或全部映射到进程地址空间，通过内存地址直接访问数据，减少系统调用开销。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 启用内存映射（256MB）&#10;PRAGMA mmap_size = 268435456;&#10;&#10;-- 禁用内存映射&#10;PRAGMA mmap_size = 0;&#10;&#10;-- 查看当前设置&#10;PRAGMA mmap_size;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 启用内存映射（256MB）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA mmap_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 268435456</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 禁用内存映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA mmap_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看当前设置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA mmap_size;</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;传统 I/O&quot;&#10;        APP1[应用] --&gt;|&quot;read() 系统调用&quot;| KERNEL1[内核] --&gt;|&quot;磁盘 I/O&quot;| DISK1[&quot;(磁盘)&quot;]&#10;        KERNEL1 --&gt;|复制到用户空间| APP1&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph mmap I/O&#10;        APP2[应用] --&gt;|直接内存访问| VADDR[虚拟地址空间]&#10;        VADDR ---|页面表映射| DISK2[&quot;(磁盘)&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"传统 I/O\"\n        APP1[应用] --&gt;|\"read() 系统调用\"| KERNEL1[内核] --&gt;|\"磁盘 I/O\"| DISK1[\"(磁盘)\"]\n        KERNEL1 --&gt;|复制到用户空间| APP1\n    end\n    subgraph mmap I/O\n        APP2[应用] --&gt;|直接内存访问| VADDR[虚拟地址空间]\n        VADDR ---|页面表映射| DISK2[\"(磁盘)\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>传统 I/O</th>\n<th>mmap I/O</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>系统调用</td>\n<td>每次读取都需要</td>\n<td>初始映射后不需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据复制</td>\n<td>内核空间 → 用户空间</td>\n<td>零复制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存管理</td>\n<td>SQLite 管理</td>\n<td>OS 管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入支持</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n<td>只读映射（SQLite 限制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n<td>读密集型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> SQLite 的 mmap 实现仅用于<strong>只读</strong>访问。写操作仍然通过传统 I/O 完成。因此 mmap 在读密集型工作负载中效果最佳。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"临时存储\">临时存储</h2><p>SQLite 在查询处理过程中可能需要创建临时表、临时索引和排序缓冲区。<strong>temp_store</strong> 控制这些临时数据的存储位置。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 临时数据存储在内存中（推荐）&#10;PRAGMA temp_store = MEMORY;&#10;&#10;-- 临时数据存储在磁盘上&#10;PRAGMA temp_store = FILE;&#10;&#10;-- 使用默认策略（编译时决定）&#10;PRAGMA temp_store = DEFAULT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 临时数据存储在内存中（推荐）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA temp_store </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MEMORY;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 临时数据存储在磁盘上</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA temp_store </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FILE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 使用默认策略（编译时决定）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA temp_store </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>temp_store 值</th>\n<th>存储位置</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DEFAULT (0)</td>\n<td>编译时决定</td>\n<td>一般场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FILE (1)</td>\n<td>磁盘临时文件</td>\n<td>内存受限环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MEMORY (2)</td>\n<td>内存</td>\n<td>内存充足，追求性能</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"vacuum\">VACUUM</h2><p><strong>VACUUM</strong> 重建整个数据库文件，消除碎片、回收删除数据留下的空闲页面、整理页面布局。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 完整 VACUUM：重建整个数据库&#10;VACUUM;&#10;&#10;-- VACUUM INTO：重建到新文件（不影响原数据库）&#10;VACUUM INTO &#39;/tmp/compacted.db&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 增量 VACUUM（需要先启用 auto_vacuum = INCREMENTAL）&#10;PRAGMA auto_vacuum = INCREMENTAL;&#10;PRAGMA incremental_vacuum(100);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 完整 VACUUM：重建整个数据库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">VACUUM;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- VACUUM INTO：重建到新文件（不影响原数据库）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">VACUUM </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTO</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/tmp/compacted.db'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 增量 VACUUM（需要先启用 auto_vacuum = INCREMENTAL）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA auto_vacuum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INCREMENTAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA incremental_vacuum(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph VACUUM 前&#10;        DB1[数据库文件&lt;br/&gt;碎片化 + 空闲页]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph VACUUM 后&#10;        DB2[数据库文件&lt;br/&gt;紧凑 + 连续]&#10;    end&#10;    DB1 --&gt;|VACUUM| DB2\">graph LR\n    subgraph VACUUM 前\n        DB1[数据库文件&lt;br/&gt;碎片化 + 空闲页]\n    end\n    subgraph VACUUM 后\n        DB2[数据库文件&lt;br/&gt;紧凑 + 连续]\n    end\n    DB1 --&gt;|VACUUM| DB2</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>VACUUM 类型</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>锁定</th>\n<th>额外空间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>VACUUM</td>\n<td>重建整个数据库</td>\n<td>排他锁</td>\n<td>需要 2x 空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VACUUM INTO</td>\n<td>重建到新文件</td>\n<td>共享锁</td>\n<td>需要 1x 空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>incremental_vacuum(N)</td>\n<td>释放 N 个空闲页</td>\n<td>短暂锁</td>\n<td>无额外空间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- auto_vacuum 模式对比&#10;-- NONE：从不自动回收（需手动 VACUUM）&#10;PRAGMA auto_vacuum = NONE;&#10;&#10;-- FULL：每次事务后自动回收空闲页&#10;PRAGMA auto_vacuum = FULL;&#10;&#10;-- INCREMENTAL：在手动调用时回收&#10;PRAGMA auto_vacuum = INCREMENTAL;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- auto_vacuum 模式对比</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- NONE：从不自动回收（需手动 VACUUM）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA auto_vacuum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NONE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- FULL：每次事务后自动回收空闲页</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA auto_vacuum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FULL;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- INCREMENTAL：在手动调用时回收</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA auto_vacuum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INCREMENTAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> VACUUM 需要约两倍数据库大小的临时磁盘空间，并持有排他锁。对于大型数据库，建议使用 <code>VACUUM INTO</code> 或 <code>incremental_vacuum</code> 来避免长时间锁定。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"analyze\">ANALYZE</h2><p><strong>ANALYZE</strong> 收集表和索引的统计信息，存储在 <code>sqlite_stat1</code>（和 <code>sqlite_stat4</code>）表中，帮助查询优化器做出更好的索引选择决策。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 分析所有表和索引&#10;ANALYZE;&#10;&#10;-- 只分析特定表&#10;ANALYZE users;&#10;&#10;-- 查看统计数据&#10;SELECT * FROM sqlite_stat1;&#10;&#10;-- sqlite_stat1 表结构：&#10;-- tbl：表名&#10;-- idx：索引名&#10;-- stat：统计信息（总行数 + 每列平均重复数）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分析所有表和索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ANALYZE;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 只分析特定表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ANALYZE users;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看统计数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sqlite_stat1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- sqlite_stat1 表结构：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- tbl：表名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- idx：索引名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- stat：统计信息（总行数 + 每列平均重复数）</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    ANALYZE[ANALYZE 命令] --&gt; STAT[sqlite_stat1&lt;br/&gt;sqlite_stat4]&#10;    STAT --&gt; OPTIMIZER[查询优化器]&#10;    OPTIMIZER --&gt; PLAN[更优的执行计划]\">graph LR\n    ANALYZE[ANALYZE 命令] --&gt; STAT[sqlite_stat1&lt;br/&gt;sqlite_stat4]\n    STAT --&gt; OPTIMIZER[查询优化器]\n    OPTIMIZER --&gt; PLAN[更优的执行计划]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 理解 stat 列的含义&#10;-- stat = &quot;10000 200 5&quot;&#10;-- 10000：表中总行数&#10;-- 200：索引第一列的平均重复行数&#10;-- 5：索引前两列组合的平均重复行数&#10;&#10;-- 选择性 = 1 / 平均重复数&#10;-- 选择性越高（接近 1/总行数），索引越有效\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 理解 stat 列的含义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- stat = \"10000 200 5\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 10000：表中总行数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 200：索引第一列的平均重复行数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 5：索引前两列组合的平均重复行数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 选择性 = 1 / 平均重复数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 选择性越高（接近 1/总行数），索引越有效</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"综合调优清单\">综合调优清单</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 生产环境综合调优模板&#10;PRAGMA journal_mode = WAL;&#10;PRAGMA synchronous = NORMAL;&#10;PRAGMA cache_size = -64000;&#10;PRAGMA mmap_size = 268435456;&#10;PRAGMA temp_store = MEMORY;&#10;PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON;&#10;PRAGMA busy_timeout = 5000;&#10;PRAGMA wal_autocheckpoint = 1000;&#10;PRAGMA auto_vacuum = INCREMENTAL;&#10;&#10;-- 定期维护任务&#10;ANALYZE;&#10;PRAGMA optimize;&#10;PRAGMA incremental_vacuum(500);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 生产环境综合调优模板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA journal_mode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WAL;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA synchronous </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NORMAL;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA cache_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA mmap_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 268435456</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA temp_store </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MEMORY;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA foreign_keys </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA busy_timeout </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA wal_autocheckpoint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA auto_vacuum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INCREMENTAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 定期维护任务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ANALYZE;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA optimize;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA incremental_vacuum(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调优维度</th>\n<th>关键参数</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>日志模式</td>\n<td>journal_mode = WAL</td>\n<td>读写并发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同步策略</td>\n<td>synchronous = NORMAL</td>\n<td>写入性能提升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存缓存</td>\n<td>cache_size = -64000</td>\n<td>减少磁盘 I/O</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存映射</td>\n<td>mmap_size = 268435456</td>\n<td>读取加速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>临时存储</td>\n<td>temp_store = MEMORY</td>\n<td>排序和临时表加速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等待超时</td>\n<td>busy_timeout = 5000</td>\n<td>避免锁冲突失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间回收</td>\n<td>auto_vacuum = INCREMENTAL</td>\n<td>自动管理数据库大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>统计信息</td>\n<td>ANALYZE / PRAGMA optimize</td>\n<td>优化器决策更准确</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((内存与调优))&#10;    页面缓存&#10;      cache_size&#10;      page_size&#10;      缓存命中率&#10;    内存映射&#10;      mmap_size&#10;      零复制读取&#10;      只读场景&#10;    临时存储&#10;      temp_store&#10;      MEMORY 模式&#10;    VACUUM&#10;      完整重建&#10;      VACUUM INTO&#10;      增量 vacuum&#10;    ANALYZE&#10;      统计信息收集&#10;      sqlite_stat1&#10;      PRAGMA optimize\">mindmap\n  root((内存与调优))\n    页面缓存\n      cache_size\n      page_size\n      缓存命中率\n    内存映射\n      mmap_size\n      零复制读取\n      只读场景\n    临时存储\n      temp_store\n      MEMORY 模式\n    VACUUM\n      完整重建\n      VACUUM INTO\n      增量 vacuum\n    ANALYZE\n      统计信息收集\n      sqlite_stat1\n      PRAGMA optimize</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>页面缓存</strong>是 SQLite 最直接的性能杠杆，合理设置 <code>cache_size</code> 可显著减少磁盘 I/O。</li>\n<li><strong>mmap</strong> 通过内存映射消除系统调用开销，适合读密集型场景。</li>\n<li><strong>VACUUM</strong> 消除碎片和回收空间，大型数据库推荐使用增量模式。</li>\n<li><strong>ANALYZE</strong> 更新统计信息，帮助优化器选择最优执行计划。</li>\n<li>综合调优应覆盖日志模式、缓存、mmap、临时存储和定期维护等多个维度。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内存与调优","id":"内存与调优"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"页面缓存","id":"页面缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"内存映射 I/O","id":"内存映射-i-o"},{"level":2,"text":"临时存储","id":"临时存储"},{"level":2,"text":"VACUUM","id":"vacuum"},{"level":2,"text":"ANALYZE","id":"analyze"},{"level":2,"text":"综合调优清单","id":"综合调优清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"WAL 与并发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/performance/wal-and-concurrency"},"next":{"title":"better-sqlite3 同步驱动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/integration/better-sqlite3"}}